          "type": "code",
          "caption": "Полный минимальный тип C++20; приложение создаёт Catalog до запуска потоков",
          "code": "#include <atomic>\n#include <memory>\n#include <mutex>\n#include <stdexcept>\n#include <vector>\n\nstruct Model { int id; /* большие неизменяемые данные */ };\nusing Snapshot = std::vector<std::shared_ptr<const Model>>;\n\nclass Catalog {\n    std::atomic<std::shared_ptr<const Snapshot>> current_{\n        std::make_shared<const Snapshot>()};\n    std::mutex writers_;\npublic:\n    std::shared_ptr<const Snapshot> read() const {\n        return current_.load(std::memory_order_acquire);\n    }\n    void append(std::shared_ptr<const Model> item) {\n        if (!item) throw std::invalid_argument(\"null model\");\n        std::lock_guard lock(writers_);\n        auto old = current_.load(std::memory_order_acquire);\n        auto next = std::make_shared<Snapshot>(*old);\n        next->push_back(std::move(item));\n        current_.store(std::move(next), std::memory_order_release);\n    }\n};"
